# Stack: TypeScript / Next.js in `{{ path }}/`

- Node {{ node_version }}, pnpm only (`pnpm add`, `pnpm exec`). Never use npm or yarn.
- Next.js App Router. Server Components by default. Add `"use client"` only
  for interactivity. Server Actions or route handlers for mutations.
- Lint and format: Biome (the hook runs it on every edit). Types: `tsc --noEmit`, strict.
  Tests: Vitest, colocated as `*.test.ts(x)`.
- Check: `scripts/check.sh ts-next`.
{%- if deploy_vercel %}
- Deploys: Vercel. Every PR gets a preview URL, and `main` deploys to
  production. Manage env vars with `vercel env`. Never commit `.env*`.
{%- endif %}
